restrictions:
  - "Alignment: any, though extremes are rare: Scrupulous 30%, Unprincipled 30%, Anarchist 20%, the rest spread among the others."
  - "Attribute requirements: none (high M.E. and I.Q. are useful, never required)."
  - "Race: humans of Russia and northern Europe only."
  - "Illiterate, with a minimal education, like most Master Psychics."
  - "Cybernetics and bionics: none to start; prefers its own psionics to any implant."
  - "Equipment beyond the starting list: one weapon for each W.P. with 1D4 E-Clips each where suitable, and some personal items. A country Cold Born outside the army also has 1D6+3 animal pelts to barter. Sovietski soldiers add an identification card, meal ration card, anti-radiation pills, an AK energy rifle, six E-Clips or clips for each weapon, a Vibro-Knife, a survival knife and two smoke grenades; a snowmobile, motorcycle, hovercycle or robot horse may be issued; and officers may carry one pistol of choice."
  - "Money: Sovietski soldiers and city dwellers have 2D4x1,000 credits plus 2D4x1,000 credits of Black Market goods; independent and country Cold Born have 4D6x100 credits plus 4D4x1,000 in Black Market goods, furs, teeth, bones, relics, ore, gems or salvaged magic items and M.D. weapons."
  - "Rank: Standard Military (Sovietski only)."
extraction_notes: "Rifts World Book 36: Sovietski printed 90-95 (cache p090-p095, cache page = printed folio + 0 for printed 38-177), a text layer; the money and Tactical Commando lines read off 130 dpi renders of printed 95, and the ladder off cache p220 (printed 224). Heading Cold Born O.C.C., tagged A psychic character class (printed 90); the block ends on printed 95 above the Cyborg Soldier O.C.C.; occ_group psychic and men_of_arms false from that heading. || XP: the Experience Tables (printed 224) print a column headed Cold Born and Wolverine People; that ladder is stored. || POWERS: abilities 2-10 are exclusive to the Cold Born and live in the class as natural_abilities, no psionic_powers rows (ruling 2026-11-22). The added-power list maps to catalog rows by name: Bio-Regenerate (Self) is Bio-Regeneration, Mask I.S.P. and Psionics is Mask I.S.P. & Psionics, See the Invisible is See The Invisible. powers_starting is 0 because the list adds powers from level 2 only; each schedule entry carries the list. Hydrokinesis counts as two selections, which has no schema shape and is prose. || BONUSES: +2D6 S.D.C., +1 initiative and +1 save vs Horror Factor stored; +3 Perception in winter conditions and +1 strike and parry with ice attacks only are conditional and prose. Master Psychic save vs psionics 10 is a threshold, not a bonus. || M.O.S.: the five packages are skills.mos options carrying the skills; their M.O.S. Bonuses are a parallel pick-one Training group. Conditional Perception and the Monster Hunter''s extra initiative vs monsters are prose. Wilderness Survival stores the general-environment bonus with the winter figure in its note; the Commando''s winter Prowl figure likewise. Surveillance includes Tailing per the book; Tailing is not granted as a separate skill. The Commando''s Demolitions-or-W.P. line is one pick over Military (Demolitions only) and Weapon Proficiencies with the group bonus of 20, because a from-list beside categories offers the list alone. 