## Lore

The Cold Born are human Master Psychics whose powers bend water, ice and
cold. Like Bursters and Zappers they wield one element at a heightened level,
in their case a refined Hydrokinesis. They appeared during the Eighty Years of
Winter that opened the Dark Age, and are a regional phenomenon: Russia,
Siberia, the Himalayas and Scandinavia, but not Alaska or northern Canada.

Unlike hot-tempered Bursters, they stay composed under fire, often with a dry
sense of humor, which lends them an air of quiet confidence. Most prefer the
countryside to cities, and love winter, hunting, trapping and fighting
monsters. They get on well with Wolverine People, Gridgitz and Yaganar.

The Sovietski has recruited them for generations as scouts, soldiers and
Spetsnaz, posted to border outposts and wilderness missions, and a few to ships
on the stormy Baltic near Kaliningrad. Those outside the army become village
protectors, monster hunters, mercenaries and wandering heroes. Their storm
warnings make them welcome among soldiers, farmers and villages from Germany
to Mongolia and China, though some would enslave them for that gift.

## GM Notes

M.O.S. packages: Hunter, Scout, Explorer, Mercenary or Adventurer and Monster
Hunter are civilian; Scout/Reconnaissance, Soldier and Tactical Commando are
Sovietski Army packages, and only one may be taken. Pick the matching Training
ability for the package''s bonuses.

Equipment Available Upon Assignment (Sovietski only): military transport on
official missions (many Cold Born cannot drive, so insertion and extraction is
provided), extra weapons, medical kit, cameras, surveillance gear and
explosives including fusion blocks, all at the local commander''s discretion.
Most hold low clearance, except Spetsnaz, and rank behind Red Army regulars
and Spetsnaz for supplies.

Added psionic powers, with I.S.P. as printed: Bio-Regenerate (Self) 6, Death
Trance 1, Hydrokinesis (varies; two selections), Mask I.S.P. and Psionics 7,
Meditation 0, Mind Block 4, Nightvision 4, Presence Sense 4, Resist Fatigue 4,
Resist Hunger 2, Resist Thirst 6, See Aura 6, See the Invisible 4, Sense
Dimensional Anomaly 4, Sense Magic 3, Sense Time 2, Summon Inner Strength 4,
Telepathy 4.
